# Quark — environment configuration
#
# OPTIONAL. Quark runs fully without any key (instant calculator + a built-in
# "demo mode" step-by-step solver). Add a key below to unlock real AI reasoning
# for multi-part problems.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in ONE of the options.
# Provider precedence: Gemini > Anthropic > OpenRouter > Groq > demo.

# --- Option A (preferred): Google Gemini ---------------------------------
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the model. gemini-2.5-flash (fast) or gemini-2.5-pro (max).
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# --- Option B: Direct Anthropic API (uses claude-opus-4-8) ---------------
# NOTE: A Claude Pro / Max (claude.ai) subscription does NOT include API access.
# The Anthropic API is billed separately. Create a key at:
#   https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Option C: OpenRouter (gateway to Claude + many models) --------------
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys . Routes to a Claude model by default.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the model (any OpenRouter model id). Default below.
OPENROUTER_MODEL=anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet

# --- Option D: Groq (very fast open models) ------------------------------
# Get a key at https://console.groq.com/keys . Great free/low-latency option.
GROQ_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the model (any Groq model id). Default below.
GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
